      "side": 1,
      "message": "Instead of adding a new resource, consider instead adding a new value to the existing config_networkAvoidBadWifi resource. It could be something like:\n\n1: Always avoid unvalidated wifi.\n0: Avoid bad unvalidated wifi on initial connect, but stay on wifi if it becomes unvalidated after connection.\n-1: Never avoid unvalidated wifi, except on captive portals or in the first few seconds after initial connect.",
